---
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-14">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-amber-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-3">Why This Exists</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
        You already know this workflow is broken
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">
        Every patent attorney has the same experience with Office Actions. Hours of manual work that follows the same pattern every time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Before -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-stone-200 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-stone-500"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-stone-700">The traditional way</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-stone-300 text-sm font-mono mt-0.5">01</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Read the Office Action</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Parse 10-20 pages of examiner arguments, identify which claims are rejected and why</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-stone-300 text-sm font-mono mt-0.5">02</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Pull up every cited reference</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Find the patents on USPTO/Google Patents, locate the specific columns and paragraphs cited</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-stone-300 text-sm font-mono mt-0.5">03</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Cross-reference claims against prior art</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Element-by-element comparison, checking if the examiner's characterization is accurate</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-stone-300 text-sm font-mono mt-0.5">04</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Decide argue vs. amend for each rejection</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Weigh the strength of arguments against the risk of losing claim scope</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-stone-300 text-sm font-mono mt-0.5">05</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Draft response with amendments</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Write arguments, draft claim amendments, verify spec support for any new limitations</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-stone-200">
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400"><span class="font-semibold text-stone-500">Typical time:</span> 4-8 hours per Office Action, depending on complexity</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- After -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border-2 border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/30 p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-amber-600"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-800">With Solve This OA For Me</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-amber-300 text-sm font-mono mt-0.5">01</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Upload everything</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Drop in the Office Action PDF, your application, and cited references. The AI reads them all natively.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-amber-300 text-sm font-mono mt-0.5">02</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Get a complete analysis in minutes</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Every rejection classified, every cited passage located and evaluated, every claim element mapped.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-amber-300 text-sm font-mono mt-0.5">03</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Review argue/amend recommendations</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Each rejection gets a strategy with confidence levels. See exactly why the AI recommends arguing vs. amending.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-amber-300 text-sm font-mono mt-0.5">04</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Refine with follow-up questions</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">"Focus on claim 3." "What if we amend to add the priority queue limitation?" "Check if Jones ¶[0045] actually teaches this."</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-amber-300 text-sm font-mono mt-0.5">05</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Export and finalize</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Use the strategy document as your starting point. You make the final calls — the AI just does the heavy lifting.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-amber-200">
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-500"><span class="font-semibold text-amber-700">Typical time:</span> 20-40 minutes, including your review and refinement</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
